id: stable-query-client
title: Stable Query Client
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The QueryClient contains the QueryCache, so you'd only want to create one instance of the QueryClient for the lifecycle of your application - "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"not"}]},{"type":"text","value":" a new instance on every render."}]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exception: It's allowed to create a new QueryClient inside an async Server Component, because the async function is only called once on the server."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rule-details","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rule Details"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"incorrect"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/stable-query-client\": \"error\" */\n\nfunction App() {\n  const queryClient = new QueryClient()\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"correct"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function App() {\n  const [queryClient] = useState(() => new QueryClient())\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"code","value":"const queryClient = new QueryClient()\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"code","value":"async function App() {\n  const queryClient = new QueryClient()\n  await queryClient.query(options)\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"attributes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attributes"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ Recommended"}]}],"checked":true},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔧 Fixable"}]}],"checked":true}]}],"headings":[{"id":"rule-details","text":"Rule Details","level":2},{"id":"attributes","text":"Attributes","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe QueryClient contains the QueryCache, so you'd only want to create one instance of the QueryClient for the lifecycle of your application - _not_ a new instance on every render.\n\n> Exception: It's allowed to create a new QueryClient inside an async Server Component, because the async function is only called once on the server.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/stable-query-client\": \"error\" */\n\nfunction App() {\n  const queryClient = new QueryClient()\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\nfunction App() {\n  const [queryClient] = useState(() => new QueryClient())\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient()\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\nasync function App() {\n  const queryClient = new QueryClient()\n  await queryClient.query(options)\n}\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [x] 🔧 Fixable\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: stable-query-client\ntitle: Stable Query Client\n---\n\nThe QueryClient contains the QueryCache, so you'd only want to create one instance of the QueryClient for the lifecycle of your application - _not_ a new instance on every render.\n\n> Exception: It's allowed to create a new QueryClient inside an async Server Component, because the async function is only called once on the server.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/stable-query-client\": \"error\" */\n\nfunction App() {\n  const queryClient = new QueryClient()\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\nfunction App() {\n  const [queryClient] = useState(() => new QueryClient())\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient()\nfunction App() {\n  return (\n    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n      <Home />\n    </QueryClientProvider>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx\nasync function App() {\n  const queryClient = new QueryClient()\n  await queryClient.query(options)\n}\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [x] 🔧 Fixable\n"}
